"The widget you are adding may load web content from the internet.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Miniprogrammet du legger til kan laste inn nettinnhold fra internett.\n"
"\n"

#: app/widgetManager.js:3437
msgid ""
"This content is subject to the widget security policy:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette innholdet er underlagt sikkerhetspolicyen for miniprogrammet:\n"
"\n"

#: app/widgetManager.js:3473
msgid ""
"This widget, {widgetId} runs a background process on your computer.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette miniprogrammet, {widgetId}, kjører en bakgrunnsprosess på datamaskinen "
"din.\n"
"\n"

#: app/widgetManager.js:3475
msgid ""
"The backend runs with your normal user permissions, just like any other "
"application you start.\n"
msgstr ""
"Programmet kjøres i bakgrunn med dine vanlige brukerrettigheter, akkurat som "
"alle andre applikasjoner du starter.\n"

#: app/widgetManager.js:3476
msgid ""
"It can access your files, system resources, and the network according to "
"your user account permissions.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Det kan få tilgang til filene dine, systemressursene og nettverket i henhold "
"til brukerkontotillatelsene dine.\n"
"\n"

#: app/widgetManager.js:3479
msgid "Command:"
msgstr "Kommando:"

#: app/widgetManager.js:3487
msgid "Only allow this for widgets you implicitly trust."
msgstr "Tillat dette bare for miniprogram du stoler 100% på."

#: app/widgetManager.js:3491
